# Internal development scratch — specs, plans, notes.
# Never tracked. The -rN filename protocol substitutes for git history here; see
# .ayder/SPEC_AND_PLAN_REVISION_GUIDE.md.
.ayder/

# Go build & test artifacts
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
/dist/
/bin/
coverage.out
coverage.html

# Go workspace files (per-developer, never shared)
go.work
go.work.sum

# MCP server wiring — absolute paths to a local dbs-vector corpus, per-developer.
# See AGENTS.md section 4, "Look before asserting".
.mcp.json

# Per-developer Claude Code state — enabled MCP servers, and the local skills
# that drive this repo's workflow. Never tracked: it is our tooling, not the
# library's, and the same rule that keeps .ayder/ out of the tree applies here.
.claude/
.codex/

# Editor & OS noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
